==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Dark Hood is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and it is obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Questionable Escort Mission]]". Unlike most other pieces of Attire, it cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* In both {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, Link will not visibly grimace in a [[Scorching Climate]] if he is wearing the Dark Hood.

